WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.667
Traces draw from separate edges and lock with restrained snaps

2
00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:09.333
Dots step on in rows; the union lane waits until duplication is legible

3
00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:14.000
Paths pull into one indigo spine; omitted work fades to untouched paper

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.667
Rules draw and values type on once; no celebratory badges

5
00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:23.333
Matched pairs align; undercovered gauges stop visibly short

6
00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:28.000
The camera settles; the next route draws only halfway — open work
